<section class="mapping-demo" aria-labelledby="mapping-title"><h2 id="mapping-title">Reads 在图路径上的定位</h2><p>原理示意：虚构图有两条路径，甲为 <code>AC → GT → TG</code>，乙为 <code>AC → CA → TG</code>。箭头只表示片段顺序；拼接后两条序列分别是 ACGTTG 和 ACCATG。</p><div class="mapping-paths"><p id="mapping-a">甲路径：<code>AC → GT → TG</code></p><p id="mapping-b">乙路径：<code>AC → CA → TG</code></p></div><div><button type="button" data-read="shared" aria-pressed="true">读段 AC</button> <button type="button" data-read="a" aria-pressed="false">读段 CGTT</button> <button type="button" data-read="b" aria-pressed="false">读段 CCAT</button> <button type="button" data-read="reset">重置</button></div><p id="mapping-explanation" aria-live="polite">AC 同时出现在两条路径中，只能支持共享片段，无法区分甲乙。</p><p>该演示使用预先确定的精确子串关系，展示歧义与分支支持；真实图比对还需处理测序错误、反向互补、重复、候选路径搜索和比对评分。</p></section>
<script>
const messages:Record<string,string>={shared:'AC 同时出现在两条路径中，只能支持共享片段，无法区分甲乙。',a:'CGTT 是甲路径 ACGTTG 的子串，跨越共享片段与甲分支；在本示例乙路径中没有该精确子串。',b:'CCAT 是乙路径 ACCATG 的子串，跨越共享片段与乙分支；在本示例甲路径中没有该精确子串。'};
for(const button of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-read]'))button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const selected=button.dataset.read==='reset'?'shared':button.dataset.read!;const a=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#mapping-a');const b=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#mapping-b');if(a)a.classList.toggle('muted',selected==='b');if(b)b.classList.toggle('muted',selected==='a');const explanation=document.querySelector('#mapping-explanation');if(explanation)explanation.textContent=messages[selected];for(const item of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-read]'))if(item.dataset.read!=='reset')item.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(item.dataset.read===selected));});
</script>
<style>.mapping-demo{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#f8fbfa;border-radius:12px;margin:32px 0}.mapping-paths{border-left:3px solid var(--teal);padding-left:16px}.mapping-demo p{font-size:.9rem}.mapping-demo button{margin:4px}.mapping-demo button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--teal);color:#fff}.muted{opacity:.35}</style>
